{"hw":"ἀνδρίς","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἀνδρίς</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀνδρίς</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ίδος</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ἡ</span>, fem. of <span class=\"gk\">ἀνήρ,</span> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">woman,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Sm.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ge.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.23</span> </span>.</div></div>"}